WEBVTT

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:23.250
Found it.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:04.930
EPISODE 6
THIRD-PARTY DEMON KILLER

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.480
It's been a while since I last came here,

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:10.600
but you've made quite a mess.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:16.320
Ayano, you don't really have to clean up.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:21.410
So, how long has it been
since she's last been here?

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:23.950
Ever since that last incident.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.370
I have no idea what's been bothering her.

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.370
Do you know anything, Ayano?

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:32.290
Who knows?

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.090
By the way, are you going to be
participating in the next auction?

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:40.760
Even if I were to,
I can't really do anything alone.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.970
Then, wanna join us as support?

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.100
No, thanks.

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:48.980
It's just a D-Class, right?

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.190
Besides...

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:57.190
I have something else to take care of.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:57.940
GO GET YOUR COUPONS
FROM THIS WEBSITE NOW!!

00:02:57.190 --> 00:02:57.940
NOTICE OF SALE
LIMITED TO CUSTOMERS

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.820
GET LIMITED
COUPONS NOW

00:02:57.940 --> 00:02:59.820
ANNUAL SUPER SALE

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.050
<i>For the D Hazard incident at Old Town...</i>

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:20.590
<i>the company in charge will be THE GUTS.</i>

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:22.380
<i>Please hurry over to the incident site.</i>

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.600
<i>Car 62 here. Roger that.</i>

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.610
To the abandoned building in Old Town.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.990
What are we gonna eat tonight?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:48.080
How about Korean BBQ?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.120
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:03.760
Are you in exam period now?
You haven't been coming by lately.
What's wrong?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.760
I've been eating instant noodles
every meal...

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.760
And my laundry's been piling up...

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:04.970
Hey, are you listening?

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.470
I can't be mad at him.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.850
Because he doesn't remember any of it.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.120
<i>Wait!</i>

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.120
<i>I wanna talk—</i>

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:21.210
<i>I'm not here... to fight you.</i>

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:24.470
<i>I came here for a contract.</i>

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.510
<i>Your power...</i>

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:31.100
<i>You are what I want!</i>

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.410
#ayanote

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.410
I came by to clean up, but I think
I should redecorate while I'm at it

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.410
34 Likes

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.300
Liked by

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.300
35 Likes

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:20.900
It's quiet.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.020
Boss, look at that!

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:31.490
What in the world?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.280
Bare hands?

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:34.950
No, this is...

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.000
Look out!

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.340
What a gruesome thing to do!

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.260
Says you.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.770
What in the world... are you?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.060
Wait! Listen to me!

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.360
Are you the one who defeated
that Demonically Possessed?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.450
You're going to challenge
my physical strength?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.410
How you underestimate me!

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.500
There's something I'd like to ask.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.130
- This—
- There she is!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.510
Stop! Don't shoot!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.030
AAA Defender Co.
Co. President
Akino Yugiri

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.960
I guess I have no choice
but to look for someone I know.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.970
Huh? Did I do something again?

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:15.550
Oh no.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.100
This would only add fuel to the fire.

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:36.870
This place?

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.370
Who are you?
What scheme are you devising using me?
I wanna make a deal with you directly.
If you don't accept a direct deal,
you'll never hear from me again.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.290
Don't look behind you.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:54.130
So you won't listen up
if we don't meet directly.

00:08:54.130 --> 00:08:55.840
You're playing hardball, huh?

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:57.140
I'm just getting tired...

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:01.970
of being manipulated by information
from some guy that I can't tell is friend or foe.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:01.970
In 18 hours, sit on the left side of a bench on the
north side on the platform of Makers Ave. Station
and wait for the next instruction.

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:07.520
Has my information ever been something
you were not seeking?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:12.320
I have my doubts because you know
everything about my circumstances.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:14.650
What exactly are you?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.860
Why are you giving me information?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:17.910
Not only that,

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:22.040
you give me info with speed and accuracy
that only the higher-ups in the City have access to.

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.330
<i>I take it someone is egging you on.</i>

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.290
<i>You should just quietly hunt down demons...</i>

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:31.670
using the information I give you.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:34.970
Anyway, answer my questions.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:39.510
If you want the answers,
first rummage through the trash can.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.800
Huh?

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:53.190
<i>There she is!</i>

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.690
<i>Stop! Don't shoot!</i>

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.540
This footage is from 30 minutes ago.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.830
This guy is The Justice.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.880
Our problem is the one
who handled him like he was just a kid.

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.920
A nun?

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.670
Be careful of the Celestial Abbey.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.470
We don't need them in this city.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.760
Hey, what does that mean—

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.730
Dammit!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.250
Dammit!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.460
He's quick to escape!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.220
<i>Stop! Don't shoot!</i>

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.440
And how is his condition?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:16.400
He sustained 26 bullet wounds all over his body,
but they were not life-threatening.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:19.070
Those guys live in a world
separate from us.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.030
Who on earth was that perpetrator?

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.990
Assaulting all of us who risk our lives
and fight for the sake of civilians...

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.330
This is utter outrage.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:33.210
We are currently investigating,
but we still have no key information.

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.250
So the information over here
is a lot slower after all.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.050
That outfit...

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.680
Is she related to a church in some way?

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.800
That's just gotta be some cosplayer.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.850
In the first place, if she's from a church, all of us
fighting demons should be heroes in her eyes.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:52.940
In any case, since we don't know
the identity or objectives of our opponent,

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.560
I would like all of you
to exercise full caution.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:11:59.860
We will contact you
if we have any further revelations.

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:04.570
The Celestial Abbey?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.580
Why didn't you talk about that earlier?

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:10.790
Well, the source of my information was shady.

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:14.120
But I thought at least you'd be forgiving
even if we were all fooled.

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.090
You really do trust me in a terrible way.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.340
So, what is this Celestial Abbey?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.300
Are they really that dangerous of a group?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.340
What are you saying after all this time?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:29.430
I taught you about the Celestial Abbey
so many times when you were still with us—

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.690
I'm sorry.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.060
I don't remember.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.940
They're a group that holds up
ideals of ultimate philanthropy.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.700
They originated in Europe...

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.570
but because they don't discriminate
against race or poverty

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.580
and reach out their hand
of salvation equally,

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.960
it's said that support for them
is strong especially from the masses.

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:58.750
So, why would a nun from such a peaceful
sounding church be this violent?

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:03.970
Because demons are not included
as a target of their philanthropy.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:05.680
That means...

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.550
They love only humans.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:12.730
Their real identity is the biggest group
of exorcists in the entire world.

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:14.310
Same industry as us?

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.270
But their scale is much different.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:21.320
After all, they deal with demons
from all over the world.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:24.320
And they've been doing it
for over a thousand years.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.070
So, foreign intervention?

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:30.030
Are they here to take
the market out from under us?

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.080
Looks like we'll have to poke Chief Ashiya.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:39.080
I'm sure that sly dog already has
this information, and yet he feigned ignorance!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.600
Hello?

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:55.480
I just wrapped up over here.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.770
Hey, can you pick me up over here?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:01.020
There's something
I can't talk about over the phone.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.530
We can have a drink in your room
while we talk—

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:10.870
AYANO

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.870
Our business has closed for today.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.490
Who, may I ask, is here?

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.330
There's something I want to ask.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:25.010
Oh, what do you need
from small companies like us...

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.930
as an exorcist from the Celestial Abbey?

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.640
Looks like that intel wasn't fake.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.810
Tell me the whereabouts of that demon.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.810
What will you do once you find out?

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:47.820
If you're fighting for the same cause as us,
I'd think you'd know why without asking.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.740
I know that she's somewhere in this city.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:55.160
And that, of all things,
you Demon Exterminators are protecting her.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:01.000
Can't you think that we have our reasons
for not getting our hands on her?

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:05.670
So, you'll resist disclosure of information
based on such reasons?

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.800
What would you do if I did resist?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:14.010
A part of your job is to be fully aware
of how and where to handle someone

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.890
to make them want to talk, right?

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:33.950
Oh, right. The thing I mentioned in the phone call
earlier that I wanted to talk about is her.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:34.620
Later!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:48.760
You're...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:49.720
What?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.520
What's so funny?

00:16:02.900 --> 00:16:04.190
Do you...

00:16:04.610 --> 00:16:06.400
have some relevance to Shu?

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:10.650
I-I-I do not! I'd been refusing
to have any relevance until the other day!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:12.910
But I don't know what got into me
that day, so to say!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:17.080
You know, I don't think
she's asking about things of that nature.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.250
Your form is just like his.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:22.460
I assume you both trained
under the same instructor or something.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.960
Oh!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.130
If you know Shu,
you should've said so first.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.800
We would've been much more amicable
in conversation if that's the case.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.470
Then tell me where he is
or where his minion is.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.300
If you do, I'll quietly walk away from here.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.010
There's no way I'd tell you!

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.930
You're all up and ready to kill them!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:42.980
Oh well.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.860
I'll somehow handle the rest by myself.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.980
- Sorry to bother you.
- Wha...

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.730
H-Hold up!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.200
Now, what to do?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:05.790
Being assaulted in my own company office...
I'm the laughingstock of the industry.

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.460
That's not what you need
to be worried about!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:12.670
She took my smartphone!
What happens if they take over my accounts?

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.760
That seems more like something
not to worry about.

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.430
A MESSAGE FROM AYANO

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:40.200
Oh, jeez!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.370
It's the middle of the night! Wait!

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.670
That woman can't be—

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.670
From Ayano:
"It's been 3 years."

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.510
Sharon!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.510
I hit the jackpot!

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:04.770
Huh?

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.060
BOSS

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.060
Boss?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:09.560
Hello?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.110
<i>Shu! I finally got a hold of you!</i>

00:18:12.110 --> 00:18:15.030
Huh? Ayano? Isn't this
the boss's number?

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.740
<i>That doesn't matter right now!</i>

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:17.950
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:22.120
Well, I was just going to kill a bit of time,
but it took a surprisingly long time.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.330
<i>So you're outside! Listen, okay?</i>

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.080
<i>You can't go back to your office!
Meet up with me right away!</i>

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.580
What's this? What's with the tenseness
in your voice and those instructions

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.750
that sound like I'm in danger
because of your mistake?

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:36.050
<i>If you understand what's up,
I don't need to say anything further!</i>

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.840
I&S OFFICE
SHU OGATA

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.800
<i>That nun came over to our place!</i>

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:42.350
<i>She took my smartphone
and likely found your address, as well!</i>

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.140
<i>And on top of it, it seems
she already knew about you!</i>

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:40.280
It definitely helped that I was attacked
in the exact same pattern minutes ago.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.820
It's been a while, Shu.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:45.280
Huh?

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:51.040
The last time we met was three years ago
when you took me to cloud nine. I think.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.050
Y-You're...

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.550
Who were you again?

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:33.000
Have you lost control of yourself
because some guy in the past forgot about you?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.550
Who were you again?

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:41.420
Wha...

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.260
Just kidding.

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:46.640
I had forgotten your face,
but I remember that sword.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:49.720
The sword that had sealed you away.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.140
Indeed, it's the most powerful demon slayer.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:56.650
Want to see if they work
on humans just as well?

00:20:57.190 --> 00:20:59.730
That's quite the bluff you have there.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.440
You can just hurry up and get down with it.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.660
I can say the same for you.

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:10.950
Well, it's true that you've lost once,
so I understand you being careful.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:13.210
It was two against one back then!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.710
Your power...

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.590
You are what I want!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.980
Nice assist, Shu.

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:42.230
Damn you, Sharon! When did you...

00:23:55.620 --> 00:24:00.040
EPISODE 7
BUT IT'S OKAY, THAT'S ENOUGH

00:23:56.700 --> 00:24:00.040
"But It's Okay, That's Enough."
